## COMPONENT LIBRARY

Document skeleton:

```
.bg-grid (fixed, z-index 0)  →  .container (max-width 1600px)
  └ .header (.logo-icon + title + .header-meta: .version, .update-pill, .date)
  └ .filters (simple .filter-select + custom .filter-multi)   [optional]
  └ .kpi-grid (auto-fit minmax(170px,1fr))  →  .kpi-card.<success|danger|warning|info|muted>
  └ .tab-nav (.tab-btn.active = var(--accent))  →  .tab-content.active
       └ .charts-grid (2-col, .chart-card.full = span all)  →  .chart-card > .chart-header + .chart-container[.tall|.short]
       └ table.dt (sortable th, hover-highlight, num in mono, .ok/.warn/.bad)
  └ .footnote
```

Available components: header, KPI cards (semantic token variants +
`.muted`), tabs, chart cards, sortable data table (`table.dt`), section
header + pills, footnote, filters bar + custom multi-select, badges/pills.

> **Hover/entry motion:** governed by the no-displacement law (ANIMATIONS
> section below) — cards never translate; hover = fade of
> background/border.

