## INSIGHTS TAB STRUCTURE (optional extension)

If a deliverable needs an insights/recommendations tab, build it from the
same primitives (a `.tab-content` with a `.charts-grid` of `.chart-card`s,
`.section-pill` for severity, semaphore color for the verdict, mono numbers).
Do not introduce a new component vocabulary; re-skin the existing cards.

1. **Key Findings** — 4-8 cards (`.chart-card`/`.kpi-card` shells), each with
   a severity pill, title, description, key metric (monospace).
2. **Recommendations** — 2-6 action cards in a responsive grid, color-coded
   by priority via the same token set; numbered title + actionable
   description with data. Scale quantity to the insights actually found.

