## QUALITY CHECKLIST

Before delivering any dashboard, verify:

### Data Integrity
- [ ] All numbers sum correctly
- [ ] Percentages add to 100% (where applicable)
- [ ] No placeholder or dummy data remains
- [ ] All calculations are accurate

### Visual Consistency
- [ ] Color usage follows semantic rules (`--success`/`--danger`/`--warning`/`--info`, no hardcoded hex outside `:root`)
- [ ] Fonts consistently use `var(--font-base)`/`var(--font-mono)` (not a mix of ad-hoc font-families)
- [ ] Accent is the token `var(--accent)` everywhere (not a one-off hex)
- [ ] Numbers formatted for the target locale (decimal separator, magnitude ladder, explicit null placeholder)
- [ ] Spacing is consistent
- [ ] All charts have proper legends

### Functionality
- [ ] All tabs work correctly
- [ ] Charts render properly
- [ ] Responsive breakpoints tested
- [ ] Animations play smoothly

### Accessibility
- [ ] Sufficient color contrast
- [ ] Text is readable at all sizes
- [ ] Interactive elements are obvious

