## FINAL NOTES

This dashboard style is designed for:
- Executive reporting and board presentations
- Data analysis and exploration
- KPI monitoring and performance tracking
- Comparative analysis (A/B, period-over-period, group comparisons)
- Survey, feedback, and sentiment analysis
- Customer/user segmentation analysis
- Operational metrics and health checks
- Financial and sales performance reviews

The dark theme conveys sophistication and reduces eye strain during extended
viewing. The token-based component library ensures consistency while
allowing flexibility for different data types and brands.

Always prioritize clarity over complexity. Every element should serve a
purpose. When in doubt, show the data simply and let the numbers speak.

